Preparation only. Compute the same SHA-256 hash used by the API for the exact JSON serialization, then insert a row such as:
INSERT INTO IdempotencyRecords ([Key], RequestHash, [Status], CreatedAt) VALUES ('PROCESSING-001', '<matching-uppercase-sha256>', 'Processing', SYSUTCDATETIME());
Do not insert a fake hash or the API will correctly treat the request as a different payload.
